; npm on this repo installs the musl builds of native packages. The dev machines are NixOS, which cannot start a
; binary linked against a generic glibc (no /lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2), and the CI runner is Ubuntu, which can run a
; static musl binary happily. So one binary runs in both places, and biome cannot be a different version in either.
libc=musl
